---
Modifications (2026-11-25): this fork replaces the Reolink Baichuan, ONVIF and RTSP clients with a client for the
eufy-security-ws bridge (ks/eufydoorbell/eufy/), renames the package to ks.eufydoorbell, removes the upstream
tests that covered the removed protocol code, and adds a Windows-safe d8 step to tools/build.py. The call screen,
chime, screen, music and settings code is the upstream project's, under the same Apache-2.0 license.
